// Uncomment to check the routes: no enemy trains (the start trains are taken out of the
// lists before TrainsTact() reads them), the player's factory builds a train, the
// reinforcement drives through both workshops to the enemy line and error.log gets the
// position of every player train ("DRIVE ...").
//#define SANDBOX_DRIVE_TEST 1
// Uncomment one to check the end of the mission: the player's train is damaged
// to 30 % and sent to its workshop ("END ... hp" in error.log shows the repair),
// then at 50 s every enemy unit (WIN) or every player unit and the factory (LOSE)
// is destroyed, and the end screen comes with win.txt / loose.txt.
//#define SANDBOX_WIN_TEST 1
